+# (every backend runs under ~/llm/bin/gpu-exec, same lock as `lockf -k ~/llm/locks/gpu.lock`).
+#   mimo         : M5-tuned stack (fused qk192/v128 NAX attention incl. SWA+sinks, split-KV multi-query
+#                  decode attention, fused MXFP4 MoE, MTP draft k=2, prefill chunk 8192) — default
+#   mimo-nomtp   : same kernels, no draft — best aggregate throughput under heavy concurrency
+#   mimo-stock   : pip MLX 0.32.2 + mlx-lm PR#1219 — known-good fallback
+#   ds41         : DeepSeek-V4.1-Flash ORIGINAL FP4/FP8 weights (Icculus), RTX box layers 0-19 + Mac 20-39 over 10GbE
+#                  (tree ~/src/wt/ds41-og), 1M; CPU supervisor falls back to the q3 build (and back) — preloaded
+#   ds41-q3      : DeepSeek-V4.1-Flash LSQ q3 + DSpark k=4, 2 concurrent requests (tree ~/src/wt/ds41-serve-c2), Mac only
+#   ds41-c1      : q3, one request at a time (tree ~/src/wt/ds41-serve) — fallback
+#   qwen38-27b   : Qwen3.8-27B dense (hybrid attention), Jundot oQ8e + MTP, stock oMLX, 1M window
+#   qwen38       : Qwen3.8-Flash-Next (180B MoE, 512 experts top-10, hybrid attention), oQ8e + MTP, 1M wrapper + layered prefill, c4, 1M (qwen38-classic = old prefill)
+#   glm53        : GLM-5.3-Flash (320B MoE, 288 experts top-8, hybrid attention), vogel61 oQ5e + grafted native MTP, stock oMLX, 1M
+# Variants on the same loaded model (no reload): <id>:nothink, <id>:greedy (mimo:greedy also drafts k=3)
+# Docs: ~/llm/README.md, numbers: ~/llm/BENCHMARKS.md
+healthCheckTimeout: 900  # > gpu-exec GPU_LOCK_WAIT (600s) + model load
